  "body_html": "<h1>maximin_upper_bound</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem maximin_upper_bound (x y : ℝ) (hx0 : 0 ≤ x) (hx1 : x ≤ 1) (hy0 : 0 ≤ y) (hy1 : y ≤ 1) : min (x * y) ((1 - x) * (1 - y)) ≤ (1 / 4 : ℝ)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
